    "title": "Hornets capitalize on Porter penalties for win | Sports | itemonline.com",
    "text": "NEW CANEY — It wasn’t pretty at first, but Huntsville remained undefeated as they escaped Porter after a dogfight.\nThe Huntsville offense struggled in the first half, as the first score came from a 56-yard fake punt from Kadon Moebes to Kentdray Cooper for the score. It was set up after Porter ran into Jonathan DeLeon on the punt.",
